以下代码能否运行？
```python
from abc import ABC, abstractmethod
class Worker(ABC):
    @abstractmethod
    def work(self):
        pass
    def start(self):
        self.setup()
        self.work()
    def setup(self):
        pass
class Coder(Worker):
    def work(self):
        print("coding")
    def setup(self):
        print("prepare")
c = Coder()
c.start()
```
